{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "f20b88a2-f3eb-4dec-b25a-864157695eae",
    "name": "Videoflix API",
    "description": "Every endpoint of the Videoflix API, in the order the cookie jar needs.\n\nThe run registers an account of its own under an address built from a timestamp, activates it with the token of the registration response, and logs out at the end, so the collection can be run again without resetting anything.\n\nAuthentication is the cookie jar of Postman and nothing else. No request carries an Authorization header.\n\nA run sends two emails through the SMTP server the .env of the backend points at: the activation email of the registration and the reset email of folder 7.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "item": [
